Rules:- (customizing context)
=============================
-de haga by7slha save f folder esmo memory/backend/CLAUD.MD msln
-de bt7dd sh5syto w eno yb2a focused aktr 3 el tools eli btst5dmha w el stack w kda
-w bt5osh 3 el site dh ta5od el rule mno w t3mlha copy past hena f CLAUDE.MD file
	-https://cursor.directory/rules/rails
-bs dh by7slo load b shakl mo3en hn3rfo b3den ??

-lma bt3ml planning mn el ahsn t5lyh y7ot el plan de f folder esmo memory/spec/CLAUDE.MD
 34an bykon 7att fyha kol el steps w kol el planning abl ma ybd2 ynfz b2a w kda.
 
 -b3d kda hy switch l sohnet mode w ht2olo y implement according ll file dh memory/spec/CLAUDE.MD 
=============================================================================
Prompts:-
=========
- /init: 
	=> ay project swa2 gded aw adem el command dh by5ly el agent yro7 yfhm kol haga
	   feh zy el structure w el schema w el codebase w kda, dh bysa3do lma btegy ts2lo.
	=> dh hy generate el kalam dh b2a fe file esmo CLAUDE.md file
	=> w 3ady kol shoia t runha 34an t update claude b kol el info el gdeda.
	 
- /exit:
	=> dh by exit el session eli sh8ala.
	
- /clear:
	=> de bt3ml clear ll session eli fat7ha w t5lek tbd2 fresh 34an lma btfdl ttklm 
	   f nfs el session m3 claude dh by5lyh ytoh w myb2ash mrkz
	   
- /compact:
	=> aw tst5dm compact dh by3ml summary l ahm el points f eli fat lw enta 3awzo
	   yfdl fakr b2a eli mktob w kda 34an ykml 3aleh.
	   
- /agents:
	=> dh hy5lek t create agents b nfsk w tkon msln ms2ola 3n code review
	   aw ms2ol 3n testing aw 3n code structure and so on.
	   w bykon mofed f el subAgents w kda.

- /ide
	=> dh by5lek t5tar ht3ml integration l claude m3 anhy editor 
	   w bydek kza e5tyar zy msln vsCode, Cursor and windsurf

- /mcp:
	=> de btwrek eh el mcp servers eli enta mstbha 3andk.
	=> context7 and playwright (dh by5lek t3ml hagat automation m3 el browser)
	=> open browser on facebook.com

/hooks:
	=> dh prompt gamd fash5 by5lek t7dd hagat t run m3 action mo3en w enta bts5dm
	   claude zy ma msln, z

- switch to plan mood:-
	=> shift + tap
	
-/model:-
	=> dh by5lek t7dd anhy model hysht8l now (opus, sonnet, and so on)
	

-/rewind:-
	=> bt5lek t3ml undo ll changes eli 3mltha w t5tar trg3 l anhy point
	   w y5lek t5tar trg3 ll conversarion bs wala ll code bs wala ll etnen
	   
	   
-/plugins:-
	=> bt3ml install mn 5elalha l kza haga.

-/context:-
	=> de btwrek enta btst5dm eh el prompt eli htktbha w btwrek lw f mcp servers running
	=> 
	
	

